      "originalText": "products.created    →  search index + inventory seed\norders.created      →  inventory reservation safety net\ninventory.reserved  →  payment transaction\npayment.*           →  orders status + inventory settle\n\nOutbox rows travel through CDC; consumers are idempotent.",
      "roughness": 0,
